{"id":"R2-02","proposed_primary":"A2","subtype":"","proposed_secondary":["D2","D3"],"cross_tags":["benchmark","prompt-injection","isolation"],"confidence":"high","evidence":"§8 pp.1–6；§5 pp.3–9；§9 pp.9–10","boundary_note":"主类是跨 4 个工具环境的通用 Agent 提示注入评测环境，研究对象是评测基础设施而非单一 Web/GUI/工具部署面，故留在 A2；具体注入攻击构造放 D2，防御评测放 D3，工具隔离等机制用 isolation 标签。","agreement":"yes"}
{"id":"R3-45","proposed_primary":"A2","subtype":"","proposed_secondary":["A3","H1"],"cross_tags":["benchmark","audit","human-in-the-loop"],"confidence":"high","evidence":"§8 pp.3–9；§5 pp.4–6；§9 p.10","boundary_note":"核心是跨 8 个数据集、safety/security 多风险面的通用 evaluator benchmark，属 A2 跨攻击面评测；其运行时监控/审计外延放 A3，危险行为与护栏外延放 H1，不因使用 LLM-as-judge 就改判 A3。","agreement":"yes"}
{"id":"R3-69","proposed_primary":"A3","subtype":"","proposed_secondary":["D2"],"cross_tags":["audit","integrity","availability"],"confidence":"high","evidence":"§8 pp.2–3、12–14；§5 pp.7–11；§9 p.15","boundary_note":"主类是面向 Agent 代码的自动化污点漏洞发现与 PoC 验证（定向灰盒 fuzzing + concolic），属 A3 漏洞发现；发现的注入类漏洞放 D2 secondary，不把工具/环境评测误归 A2。","agreement":"yes"}
{"id":"R3-79","proposed_primary":"B2","subtype":"","proposed_secondary":["B4","E3"],"cross_tags":["skills","least-privilege","access-control","policy","audit"],"confidence":"high","evidence":"§8 pp.1–2、9–13；§5 pp.4–9；§9 p.14","boundary_note":"核心是任务条件化的动作级最小权限分析与 artifact 重写，属 B2；其离线策略审计/约束生成放 B4，Skills 供应链放 E3。B4a 不作为主类，因为运行时强制仍依赖 Agent 的 LLM 解释语义 guard，而非独立引用监视器。","agreement":"yes"}
{"id":"R3-02","proposed_primary":"B4","subtype":"B4a","proposed_secondary":["A3","I1"],"cross_tags":["mobile","gui","audit","policy","benchmark"],"confidence":"high","evidence":"§8 pp.2–4；§5 pp.6–8；§9 pp.13–14","boundary_note":"核心是移动 Agent 完整轨迹的策略条件化事后审计，属 B4a 策略审计；移动 GUI 环境放 I1，监控/审计方法放 A3，不把移动 benchmark 当主类。","agreement":"yes"}
{"id":"R3-42","proposed_primary":"C1","subtype":"","proposed_secondary":["A2"],"cross_tags":["privacy","pii","benchmark","human-in-the-loop"],"confidence":"high","evidence":"§8 pp.1–5；§5 pp.4–6；§9 pp.9–10","boundary_note":"研究对象是隐私规范与数据最小化的行动级评测，按对象分支归 C1，而非通用 A2；benchmark 构建方法放 A2 secondary，威胁模型不含恶意攻击者。","agreement":"yes"}
{"id":"R2-23","proposed_primary":"C3","subtype":"","proposed_secondary":["C1","G2"],"cross_tags":["privacy","pii","delegation","confidentiality","benchmark"],"confidence":"high","evidence":"§8 pp.2、7–9；§5 pp.4–6；§9 p.9","boundary_note":"核心是本地/远程 LLM 之间的块级路由以减少 PII 跨服务外传，属 C3；数据最小化放 C1，multi-LLM 协作架构放 G2；不归 G2 主类，因为研究问题是信息流而非架构评测。","agreement":"yes"}
{"id":"R3-59","proposed_primary":"C4","subtype":"","proposed_secondary":["G2"],"cross_tags":["multi-agent","privacy","confidentiality"],"confidence":"high","evidence":"§8 pp.1–2；§5 pp.4–6；§9 p.9","boundary_note":"首要资产是 MAS 内部通信拓扑这一未公开内部信息，黑盒查询+表示学习用于拓扑推断，符合 C4“内部信息提取、再识别与拓扑推断”；G2 仅在“对象是多 Agent 拓扑”意义上作 secondary，不把攻击误判为架构评测。","agreement":"yes"}
{"id":"R3-16","proposed_primary":"D2","subtype":"","proposed_secondary":["A2","I1","D1"],"cross_tags":["web","prompt-injection","benchmark","jailbreak"],"confidence":"high","evidence":"§8 pp.1–2、5–8；§5 pp.3–5；§9 p.8","boundary_note":"核心是 Web Agent 上的说服式任务重定向注入攻击与基准，按注入攻击对象归 D2；benchmark 方法放 A2，Web 执行环境放 I1，劝说/操纵机理放 D1。","agreement":"yes"}
{"id":"R3-71","proposed_primary":"D2","subtype":"","proposed_secondary":["D3"],"cross_tags":["prompt-injection","integrity","confidentiality"],"confidence":"high","evidence":"§8 pp.3–4、9–10；§5 pp.3–6；§9 p.14","boundary_note":"核心是检索阶段的间接提示注入端到端攻击（trigger/attack 分解 + 黑盒前缀优化），属 D2；防御规避与检测讨论放 D3。不是 A2，因为贡献不是通用 benchmark。","agreement":"yes"}
{"id":"R3-04","proposed_primary":"D3","subtype":"","proposed_secondary":["D2","A3"],"cross_tags":["prompt-injection","audit","tool-selection"],"confidence":"high","evidence":"§8 pp.1–2、7–8；§5 pp.4–5；§9 p.9","boundary_note":"核心是间接提示注入的运行时检测/防御（masked re-execution + 工具调用比较），属 D3；被防御的注入攻击放 D2，运行时监控放 A3；不归 D4，因为检测单步工具调用而非轨迹级控制流。","agreement":"yes"}
{"id":"R3-85","proposed_primary":"D4","subtype":"","proposed_secondary":["D2","B2","E2"],"cross_tags":["prompt-injection","least-privilege","provenance","policy"],"confidence":"high","evidence":"§8 pp.1–2、8–12；§5 pp.5–9；§9 pp.12–14","boundary_note":"核心是 agentic workflow 的多步控制流劫持（路径分析→prompt provenance→能力探测→tool-call chain 进化），属 D4；单点注入入口放 D2，最小权限/能力约束放 B2，工具链滥用放 E2。","agreement":"yes"}
{"id":"R1-12","proposed_primary":"E2","subtype":"","proposed_secondary":["E1","C3"],"cross_tags":["tool-selection","prompt-injection","privacy","integrity"],"confidence":"high","evidence":"§8 pp.1–2、10–12；§5 pp.3–10；§9 p.12","boundary_note":"核心是恶意工具元数据劫持工具选择并跨工具收割/污染数据，属 E2；工具投毒机制放 E1，跨工具数据外传放 C3。不是 E1 主类，因为重点在 tool selection 与跨工具控制流。","agreement":"yes"}
{"id":"R2-03","proposed_primary":"F1","subtype":"","proposed_secondary":["H2"],"cross_tags":["memory","backdoor","integrity"],"confidence":"high","evidence":"§8 p.3、7–8；§5 pp.5–6；§9 p.13","boundary_note":"核心是向长期记忆/RAG 知识库注入少量恶意演示并优化触发词，属 F1 记忆/知识库投毒；后门触发机制放 H2；不是 C2，因为研究完整性与检索劫持而非个人隐私。","agreement":"yes"}
{"id":"R2-21","proposed_primary":"G2","subtype":"","proposed_secondary":["A2","G3"],"cross_tags":["multi-agent","benchmark","prompt-injection","tool-selection"],"confidence":"high","evidence":"§8 p.2、14；§5 pp.3–6；§9 p.9","boundary_note":"核心是多 Agent 系统对抗风险基准，对象是多 Agent 架构与配置，属 G2 而非通用 A2；benchmark 方法放 A2，串谋/冒充/消息级攻击放 G3。","agreement":"yes"}
{"id":"R3-43","proposed_primary":"G3","subtype":"","proposed_secondary":["C3","A1"],"cross_tags":["multi-agent","privacy","confidentiality","benchmark"],"confidence":"high","evidence":"§8 pp.1–4、6–8；§5 pp.4–6；§9 p.10","boundary_note":"核心是多 Agent 通过隐写进行秘密串谋与隐蔽通信，属 G3；隐蔽跨 Agent 信息流放 C3，威胁模型/定义与能力评测框架放 A1；不归 G4，因为重点是串谋攻击而非恶意 Agent 检测。","agreement":"yes"}
{"id":"R3-67","proposed_primary":"G4","subtype":"","proposed_secondary":["G2","D2"],"cross_tags":["multi-agent","prompt-injection","integrity"],"confidence":"medium","evidence":"§8 p.1、7；§5 pp.3–4；§9 pp.6–7","boundary_note":"核心是向多 Agent 软件开发系统注入恶意需求/恶意 Agent，并用提示词防御，属 G4（恶意 Agent 防御）；G2 放框架/阶段评测，D2 放需求与 agent profile 注入。防御仅为 prompt 自检、非独立检测，故置信度 medium。","agreement":"yes"}
{"id":"R3-37","proposed_primary":"H1","subtype":"","proposed_secondary":["D4","A3"],"cross_tags":["jailbreak","benchmark","policy"],"confidence":"high","evidence":"§8 pp.1–2、5–7；§5 pp.5–6；§9 p.10","boundary_note":"核心产物是推理时轻量序列监控/护栏，在有害步骤前 halt，属 H1 运行时护栏与危险任务安全；D4 描述其对抗的分解式多步攻击形态，A3 对应监控机制，均作 secondary。","agreement":"yes"}
{"id":"R2-20","proposed_primary":"H3","subtype":"","proposed_secondary":["A2","H1","D2"],"cross_tags":["benchmark","prompt-injection","mcp","pii"],"confidence":"high","evidence":"§8 p.2、4–9；§5 pp.4–7；§9 p.10","boundary_note":"核心用 threat snapshot 隔离并评测骨干 LLM 自身的漏洞，研究对象是骨干模型鲁棒性，属 H3；b3 benchmark 方法放 A2，安全/拒绝行为放 H1，注入入口放 D2；不因是 benchmark 就归 A2。","agreement":"yes"}
{"id":"R3-64","proposed_primary":"I1","subtype":"","proposed_secondary":["A2","H1","D2"],"cross_tags":["mobile","gui","benchmark","prompt-injection","privacy"],"confidence":"high","evidence":"§8 p.1、3–7；§5 pp.3–6；§9 p.8","boundary_note":"核心是 Android 模拟器上的移动设备控制安全基准，按 v1.1 A2 收紧规则（特定环境 benchmark 回对象分支）归 I1；benchmark 方法放 A2，拒绝/过度拒绝放 H1，IPI 任务放 D2。","agreement":"yes"}
